NHL94AGA - native Amiga 1200 AGA port of NHL '94 (see Credits.txt)

Needs: Kickstart 3.0 or newer, a 68020 or better, the AGA chipset (Amiga 1200, 4000, CD32
hardware). A stock A1200 (2 MB Chip RAM, no Fast RAM) is the machine it is built for.

Boot this disk, or run DF0:NHL94AGA from your own Shell or Workbench. The program checks the
machine, takes it over the way the Amiga's own libraries allow, and gives it back when you press
the left mouse button or a fire button. Its log goes to NHL94AGA.log on this disk (or RAM:
when the disk is write-protected). Changelog.txt says what each version does and how to test it.
